	<p style="text-align: center;" align="justify"><strong><span style="font-size: 20px;">"GOOD ENOUGH" IS NOT PART OF OUR MANTRA</span></strong></p>
<p align="justify">Leading Edge is the first company to address this problem, and our soundbar eliminates the need for complicated and costly installation. Simple one-cable connection.</p>
<p align="justify">If you are dedicated to a student's successful education, just "good enough" is NOT good enough. Our signature sound is simply amazing. It carries through every one of our products. Vocals are stunningly crisp with just the right amount of bass that makes voices sound comfortable all day and doesnâ€™t require a subwoofer that would rattle the classroom next door. We donâ€™t build our speaker systems to favor car chases or booms and bangs. And this is the first soundbar to be specially designed for maximum loudness before feedback with wireless teacher-worn microphones.</p>
