<p>The sound source, in this case the soundbar, needs to be above the video display but angled down to the students throughout the classroom.&nbsp; The KARTBar is perfect for mobile carts, which all need quality sound. Just add a compact power amp and you have an extraordinary sound that goes anywhere.</p>
