<h3 style="text-align: center;" align="justify"><strong>High Definition Audio is on a roll</strong></h3>
<p align="justify">Interactive display panels have revolutionized the classroom, but they often have not kept pace with the audio potential.&nbsp; Mobile carts present a whole new challenge to audio, but the KARTBar was designed especially for this task with tilted mounting bars and a lightweight package that will interface so easily with virtually every display panel's back panel VESA mounts.</p>
