<div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-node-ieyq2jbro5zh" data-node="ieyq2jbro5zh">
	<div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content">
		<div class="fl-rich-text">
	<p align="justify">Leading Edge Sound Arrays is a collaboration of 3 audio professionals with over 100 years of combined experience in the design, sales, and manufacturing of professional audio.&nbsp;&nbsp; Our systems are designed and assembled in the USA with worldwide components.&nbsp; In a video-rich world, we are totally committed to providing stunning vocal audio for the classroom environment.&nbsp; We have spent years listening to sound installers, school technicians, audiologists, teachers, and administrators and we want to make sure every word is always heard.</p>
</div>
	</div>
</div>

