		<div class="fl-rich-text">
	<p align="justify"><strong>Frank Grund</strong> is the co-owner of Grundorf Corporation which is the manufacturing facility where all Leading Edge Sound Arrays are assembled.&nbsp; Grundorf has been building high-quality speaker enclosures for over 30 years in their Council Bluffs, Iowa factory.&nbsp;&nbsp; Frank lends vast technical experience and testing facilities for the final perfection of our systems.&nbsp; Frank also has a background as a Midwest touring musician and also an educator in recording processes and techniques.&nbsp; He also currently maintains a 24 track home studio and occasionally records aspiring local area music acts.</p>
</div>
