	<p align="justify"><strong>Jerry Hogerson</strong>&nbsp;is the concept designer of Leading Edge Sound Arrays.&nbsp;&nbsp; Jerryâ€™s concert audio mixing and musician background led to working with Altec Lansing in the 1970s developing professional audio products and later, sales management positions.&nbsp; In 1977, Jerry started his sales rep firm, Star Enterprises, and for 30 years, represented such companies as &nbsp;JBL, Soundcraft,&nbsp; and Audio Technica. &nbsp;In 2007, Jerry began a lengthy relationship with TeachLogic, a manufacturer of wireless microphone-based sound systems for the classroom.&nbsp;&nbsp; All this combined into a lifelong experience of working with loudspeakers and their interactions with microphones. Star Enterprises is the exclusive manufacturerâ€™s sales representative for Leading Edge Sound Arrays in Southern California, Arizona, Hawaii, and Southern Nevada.</p>
</div>
