	<p align="justify"><strong>John Grandinetti</strong> is the National Sales Director of Leading Edge Sound Arrays.&nbsp; A native Nebraskan like Jerry, John followed his music dreams to California in the 1970s.&nbsp;&nbsp; His decades-long sales background around the world was varied in all aspects of both retail and factory sales of loudspeakers, microphones and music equipment working with such companies as Cerwin Vega, InMusic Brands and Samson Technologies. He brings a wealth of sales relationship experience to the team.&nbsp; We are a people company and John will be reaching out to many of audio and educationâ€™s best.&nbsp;&nbsp; John is also a terrific writer of fiction and non-fiction and his books are available on Amazon under his name.</p>
